---
const APP_URL = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_APP_URL || 'https://app.grassion.com'
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Pricing · Grassion</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Free for small teams. Team at $99/month flat for up to 25 developers (₹4,999 in India). Growth for larger teams." />
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/Grassion%20single%20logo%20(1).png" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Mono:wght@300;400;500&family=DM+Sans:ital,opsz,wght@0,9..40,200;0,9..40,300;0,9..40,400;1,9..40,300&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

    :root {
      --black: #0a0a0a;
      --white: #ffffff;
      --dim: rgba(255,255,255,0.62);
      --dimmer: rgba(255,255,255,0.35);
      --line: rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
    }

    html, body {
      background: var(--black);
      color: var(--white);
      font-family: 'DM Sans', sans-serif;
    }

    /* ── HEADER ─────────────────────────────── */
    header {
      position: fixed;
      top: 0; left: 0; right: 0;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      padding: 18px 52px;
      z-index: 100;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.85);
      backdrop-filter: blur(16px);
    }

    nav { display: flex; gap: 40px; align-items: center; }
    nav a {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 300;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--dim);
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    nav a:hover, nav a.active { color: var(--white); }
    .cta-btn { cursor: pointer; }
    .cta-btn:hover { color: var(--black); opacity: 0.85; }

    /* ── MAIN ───────────────────────────────── */
    main {
      padding: 120px 52px 80px;
      max-width: 1240px;
      margin: 0 auto;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      font-weight: 400;
      letter-spacing: 0.28em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--dim);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 14px;
    }
    .eyebrow::before {
      content: '';
      display: block;
      width: 36px; height: 1px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.28);
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(36px, 4vw, 56px);
      font-weight: 200;
      line-height: 1.1;
      letter-spacing: -0.025em;
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .hero-sub {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--dim);
      margin-bottom: 60px;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    /* ── PLAN GRID ──────────────────────────── */
    .plans-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 1px;
      background: var(--line);
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      margin-bottom: 80px;
    }

    .plan-card {
      background: #141414;
      padding: 40px 28px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      position: relative;
    }

    .plan-card.featured {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    }

    .plan-popular {
      position: absolute;
      top: -1px; left: 50%;
      transform: translateX(-50%);
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 8px;
      letter-spacing: 0.18em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--black);
      padding: 4px 12px;
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .plan-name {
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      letter-spacing: 0.22em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.62);
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .plan-price {
      font-size: 32px;
      font-weight: 200;
      letter-spacing: -0.02em;
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      line-height: 1;
    }

    .plan-price-sub {
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.38);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
      line-height: 1.5;
    }

    .plan-seats {
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
      margin-bottom: 4px;
    }

    .plan-best {
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 9px;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.44);
      margin-bottom: 28px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    .plan-divider {
      height: 1px;
      background: var(--line);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .plan-features {
      list-style: none;
      flex: 1;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .plan-features li {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--dim);
      padding: 7px 0;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.04);
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 10px;
      line-height: 1.4;
    }

    .plan-features li::before {
      content: '·';
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.50);
      flex-shrink: 0;
      margin-top: 1px;
    }

    .plan-features li.inherit {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.44);
      font-size: 12px;
    }
    .plan-features li.inherit::before { content: '↳'; font-size: 10px; }

    .plan-cta {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
      padding: 13px;
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      text-decoration: none;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
      color: var(--white);
      transition: background 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
    }

    .plan-cta:hover {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.06);
      border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.4);
    }

    .plan-card.featured .plan-cta {
      background: var(--white);
      color: var(--black);
      border-color: var(--white);
    }
    .plan-card.featured .plan-cta:hover { opacity: 0.87; }

    .plan-hint {
      text-align: center;
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 9px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.42);
      letter-spacing: 0.1em;
      margin-top: 10px;
    }

    /* ── PAYMENT NOTE ──────────────────────── */
    .payment-note {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 18px 24px;
      margin-bottom: 60px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);
    }

    .payment-note-icon {
      width: 36px; height: 36px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.20);
      border-radius: 4px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 9px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.52);
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
    }

    .payment-note-text {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--dim);
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    .payment-note-text strong {
      color: var(--white);
      font-weight: 400;
    }

    /* ── PRIVACY SECTION ────────────────────── */
    .privacy-section {
      border: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 28px 32px;
      margin-bottom: 60px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03);
    }

    .privacy-label {
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 9px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.24em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
      margin-bottom: 16px;
    }

    .privacy-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
      gap: 16px 40px;
    }

    .privacy-item {
      font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--dim);
      line-height: 1.6;
      display: flex;
      gap: 10px;
    }

    .privacy-item::before {
      content: '·';
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.40);
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    /* ── FAQ ────────────────────────────────── */
    .faq-section { margin-bottom: 60px; }

    .faq-label {
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 9px;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.24em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.55);
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    details {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line);
    }

    summary {
      cursor: pointer;
      padding: 20px 0;
      font-size: 15px;
      font-weight: 300;
      list-style: none;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      color: var(--white);
      user-select: none;
    }

    summary::-webkit-details-marker { display: none; }

    summary::after {
      content: '+';
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.52);
      transition: transform 0.2s;
    }

    details[open] summary::after {
      transform: rotate(45deg);
    }

    details p {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 300;
      color: var(--dim);
      line-height: 1.7;
      padding-bottom: 20px;
    }

    details a { color: var(--white); text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 3px; }

    /* ── FOOTER ─────────────────────────────── */
    footer {
      border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
      padding: 20px 52px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
    }

    footer span {
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      color: var(--dimmer);
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    }

    footer a {
      font-family: 'DM Mono', monospace;
      font-size: 10px;
      color: var(--dimmer);
      letter-spacing: 0.08em;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.2s;
    }
    footer a:hover { color: var(--white); }

    /* ── MOBILE ─────────────────────────────── */
    @media (max-width: 1023px) {
      .plans-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .privacy-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    }

    @media (max-width: 767px) {
      header { padding: 14px 16px; }
      nav { gap: 16px; }

      main { padding: 88px 24px 60px; }

      h1 { font-size: clamp(28px, 9vw, 40px); }

      .plans-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }

      .payment-note { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }

      .privacy-section { padding: 20px; }

      footer { padding: 16px 24px; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; text-align: center; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <header>
    <a href="/"><img src="/W+L.png" alt="Grassion" style="height:28px;" onerror="this.style.display='none'" /></a>
    <nav>
      <a href="/">Home</a>
      <a href="/about/">About</a>
      <a href="/pricing/" class="active">Pricing</a>
      <a href="/contact/">Contact</a>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <div class="eyebrow">Pricing</div>
    <h1>Start free.<br />Scale with your team.</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub">
      Free for small teams. Team at $99/month flat for up to 25 developers.<br />
      14-day trial on Team · no credit card required · cancel anytime.
    </p>

    <!-- PLAN CARDS -->
    <div class="plans-grid">

      <!-- Free -->
      <div class="plan-card">
        <div class="plan-name">Free</div>
        <div class="plan-price">$0</div>
        <div class="plan-price-sub">forever</div>
        <div class="plan-seats">Up to 5 active developers</div>
        <div class="plan-best">1 repo · always free</div>
        <div class="plan-divider"></div>
        <ul class="plan-features">
          <li>Merge Receipts — last 30 days with AI source, reviewer and attestation</li>
          <li>Trend chart: AI-heavy % vs attested % over 6 months</li>
          <li>Exceptions: PRs merged without review flagged instantly</li>
          <li>Risk Map — top 3 fragile &amp; dark areas</li>
          <li>GitHub check run on every PR</li>
          <li>GitHub App · 5-minute setup</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="plan-cta" href={`${APP_URL}/login`}>Get Started Free</a>
        <p class="plan-hint">No credit card · no time limit</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Team (featured) -->
      <div class="plan-card featured">
        <div class="plan-popular">Most Popular</div>
        <div class="plan-name">Team</div>
        <div class="plan-price">$99</div>
        <div class="plan-price-sub">flat / month · up to 25 developers<br />₹4,999 in India · 14-day trial</div>
        <div class="plan-seats">All repos · full history</div>
        <div class="plan-best">Everything you need for compliance</div>
        <div class="plan-divider"></div>
        <ul class="plan-features">
          <li class="inherit">Everything in Free</li>
          <li>All repos · no limit</li>
          <li>Full receipt history — unlimited date range</li>
          <li>Audit Export — date-range CSV or PDF</li>
          <li>Full Risk Map — unlimited fragile &amp; dark area list</li>
          <li>Share a report via public link</li>
          <li>Slack /grassion who &lt;path&gt;</li>
          <li>MCP server for AI coding agents</li>
          <li>Weekly dark-code digest email</li>
          <li>AI root-cause summaries on problem PRs</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="plan-cta" href={`${APP_URL}/login`}>Start Free Trial</a>
        <p class="plan-hint">14-day trial · no card required</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Growth -->
      <div class="plan-card">
        <div class="plan-name">Growth</div>
        <div class="plan-price">$8</div>
        <div class="plan-price-sub">per developer / month above 25<br />Team plan base included</div>
        <div class="plan-seats">25+ developer teams</div>
        <div class="plan-best">Block merges on critical areas</div>
        <div class="plan-divider"></div>
        <ul class="plan-features">
          <li class="inherit">Everything in Team</li>
          <li>Block PR merge on critical dark areas</li>
          <li>Per-repo review rules</li>
          <li>Scales with your team size</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="plan-cta" href="/contact/">Talk to Us</a>
        <p class="plan-hint">We respond within 24 hours</p>
      </div>

      <!-- Audit Pack -->
      <div class="plan-card">
        <div class="plan-name">Audit Pack</div>
        <div class="plan-price">$500</div>
        <div class="plan-price-sub">one-time purchase<br />no subscription required</div>
        <div class="plan-seats">Any team · any plan</div>
        <div class="plan-best">Already in an audit?</div>
        <div class="plan-divider"></div>
        <ul class="plan-features">
          <li>One historical audit export for any date range</li>
          <li>Full CSV + PDF with Merge Receipt evidence</li>
          <li>AI source, reviewer, attestation per PR</li>
          <li>SHA-256 hash chain for tamper evidence</li>
          <li>Use it once · no recurring charge</li>
        </ul>
        <a class="plan-cta" href="/contact/">Purchase Audit Pack</a>
        <p class="plan-hint">Write to us to arrange payment</p>
      </div>

    </div>

    <!-- ENTERPRISE ROW -->
    <div class="payment-note" style="margin-bottom: 32px;">
      <div class="payment-note-icon" style="font-size:8px; letter-spacing:0.04em;">ENT</div>
      <p class="payment-note-text">
        <strong>Need Business or Enterprise?</strong>
        SSO, custom data retention, self-hosted deployment, dedicated SLA, SOC2 &amp; AI governance evidence — write to
        <a href="mailto:info@grassion.com" style="color:var(--white);">info@grassion.com</a> or
        <a href="/contact/" style="color:var(--white);">use the contact form</a>.
        We respond within 24 hours.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- PAYMENT NOTE -->
    <div class="payment-note">
      <div class="payment-note-icon">PAY</div>
      <p class="payment-note-text">
        <strong>Team is $99/month flat for up to 25 developers. ₹4,999/month for India-billed accounts.</strong>
        Charged via Razorpay. Supports credit/debit cards, UPI, and netbanking.
        Clicking "Start Free Trial" takes you to the dashboard — choose your plan there to go directly to checkout.
        Features activate instantly after payment.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- PRIVACY CONTROLS -->
    <div class="privacy-section">
      <div class="privacy-label">Privacy controls — all plans</div>
      <div class="privacy-grid">
        <div class="privacy-item">Managers see coverage by area and team. Per-person evidence is visible to that person and used for routing only — no per-person ranking or export anywhere.</div>
        <div class="privacy-item"><strong>Team-only mode</strong> (org setting): store only area and team aggregates, no per-person data. Available for EU customers on any plan.</div>
        <div class="privacy-item">Per-developer metrics (adoption by member) are admin-only and off by default. Enable in Settings.</div>
        <div class="privacy-item">Data deletion from Settings removes all coverage data within 24 hours — including backups.</div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <!-- FAQ -->
    <div class="faq-section">
      <div class="faq-label">Billing FAQ</div>

      <details>
        <summary>What is included in the Team plan?</summary>
        <p>Team is $99/month flat for up to 25 active developers. It includes all repos, full receipt history, Audit Export (CSV + PDF), full Risk Map, Slack /grassion who, MCP tokens, weekly digest emails, and AI root-cause summaries. It is the right plan for most engineering teams doing compliance or AI governance work.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>How does Team plan pricing work for INR?</summary>
        <p>If your Razorpay account is billed in India, the Team plan is ₹4,999/month flat for up to 25 developers. Growth overage pricing in INR is available on request — write to <a href="mailto:info@grassion.com">info@grassion.com</a>.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>What counts as an "active developer" on the Growth plan?</summary>
        <p>A GitHub user who opened or reviewed a pull request in the current billing month. Developers inactive that month are not counted. Growth charges $8/developer/month only for developers beyond your first 25 — the base Team plan covers those 25.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Is there an annual plan discount?</summary>
        <p>Annual pricing is available on request. Write to <a href="mailto:info@grassion.com">info@grassion.com</a> to arrange annual billing.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Which payment methods are supported?</summary>
        <p>Credit/debit cards (domestic and international), UPI, and netbanking via Razorpay. Annual invoicing available on request.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>What happens after the free trial?</summary>
        <p>You'll be prompted to choose a plan and add a payment method. No charge is made until you confirm. If you don't subscribe, your account reverts to the Free plan — data is retained.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Do you offer refunds?</summary>
        <p>Pro-rated refunds for annual plans. Monthly plans are evaluated case-by-case; write to <a href="mailto:info@grassion.com">info@grassion.com</a>.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>Can I upgrade or downgrade anytime?</summary>
        <p>Yes. Plan changes take effect at the next billing cycle. Upgrades can be applied immediately on request.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>What does the Audit Pack include?</summary>
        <p>A one-time historical audit export for a date range you specify. The export contains, for each merged PR: AI source and confidence, reviewer names, attestation answers, check run conclusion, and a SHA-256 hash for tamper evidence. Source code and diffs are never included. No subscription required — it is a single $500 purchase.</p>
      </details>

      <details>
        <summary>What does Free plan limit to 30 days?</summary>
        <p>On the Free plan, the Merge Receipts list and receipt detail only show PRs merged in the last 30 days. Audit Export is not available. Upgrading to Team unlocks full history and date-range exports immediately.</p>
      </details>
    </div>

  </main>

  <footer>
    <span>© 2026 Grassion Intelligence</span>
    <div style="display:flex; gap:24px;">
      <a href="/security/">Security</a>
      <a href="/privacy/">Privacy</a>
      <a href="/terms/">Terms</a>
      <a href="mailto:info@grassion.com">info@grassion.com</a>
    </div>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
